# Security & Compliance Rules

1. Zero hardcoded secrets: Never hardcode passwords, API keys, or JWT tokens.
2. The audit ledger is strictly append-only. Any attempt to mutate previous blocks must be treated as a security violation.
3. Every digital evidence export must include a Section 63 BSA 2023 compliance signature with SHA-256 integrity hash.
4. Mask PII in default views: Mask middle digits of phone numbers (`9876XXXX10`) and bank accounts (`XXXX-XXXX-9910`).
5. All file uploads must validate MIME types and file extensions. Max size: 50MB.
